a6=a2?"Bring each white edge straight to the bottom, matching the side centre (see Step 1).":"\u0110\u01b0a t\u1eebng c\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng th\u1eb3ng xu\u1ed1ng d\u01b0\u1edbi, kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi t\xe2m b\xean c\u1ea1nh (xem B\u01b0\u1edbc 1)."
a5=A.a([a5,a6,a2?"Exercise: scramble, solve only the cross, repeat 10 times, aim for under 15 seconds.":"B\xe0i t\u1eadp: x\xe1o cube, ch\u1ec9 gi\u1ea3i d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng, l\u1eb7p 10 l\u1ea7n, m\u1ee5c ti\xeau d\u01b0\u1edbi 15 gi\xe2y."],s)
